{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_inn","model_identifier":"halfling_inn","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_inn\n\nHalfling inn: a two-storey timber inn half dug into a grassy hill, mustard-and-green shutters, a round door, a swinging sign and benches outside.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 9 columns (160 x 144 units, 4.50 x 4.05 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -76..76, y 0..188, z -54..84 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 162, construction_0 53, construction_33 102, construction_66 122, ruined 170 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- inn: 112 x 180 x 60 centred at x 0, z -6\n- hill behind: 152 x 120 x 60 at z 40\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `halfling_inn_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `halfling_inn_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_halfling_inn` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-20, 0, -46)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-40, 189, 0)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"inn_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-58.0,0.0,-38.0],"to":[58.0,3.0,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[248.0,493.0,364.0,496.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,499.0,64.0,502.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[248.0,493.0,364.0,496.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,499.0,64.0,502.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[390.0,198.0,506.0,262.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[390.0,198.0,506.0,262.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"23b589b3-5792-5911-921d-706604d42093"},{"name":"inn_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,3.0,-36.0],"to":[56.0,87.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20.0,0.0,132.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[184.0,0.0,188.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20.0,0.0,132.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[184.0,0.0,188.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[126.0,483.0,238.0,487.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[126.0,483.0,238.0,487.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"25a6df05-47c2-54e6-9775-6b543bf92eef"},{"name":"inn_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,3.0,20.0],"to":[56.0,87.0,24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20.0,0.0,132.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[188.0,0.0,192.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20.0,0.0,132.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[188.0,0.0,192.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[238.0,483.0,350.0,487.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[238.0,483.0,350.0,487.0]